{"3364130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Addie Shen", "steam_appid": 3364130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addie Shen is a math based puzzle shooter. Play solo, team up in co-op, or practice your skills to stop the evil PEMDAS minions. Can you save the world with math?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.poster.avif?t=1786508984\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.webm?t=1786508984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.mp4?t=1786508984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between quadrants, dodge tricky tangents, and foil PEMDAS' calculated plans with the future of math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.poster.avif?t=1786508984\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.webm?t=1786508984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.mp4?t=1786508984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRACTICE MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your wits in fast paced, wave based exercises to help sharpen your math skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/1a42f3c8bffbcfe8831fb5d988890a31.poster.avif?t=1786508984\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/1a42f3c8bffbcfe8831fb5d988890a31.webm?t=1786508984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/1a42f3c8bffbcfe8831fb5d988890a31.mp4?t=1786508984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up for split screen challenges<strong>.</strong> Whether cooperating or competing, it’s math-driven mayhem at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural math equations for infinite playthroughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode with 5 narrative missions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Mode with addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, and more</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Mode with 4 competitive missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 player split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of math puns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculus?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addie Shen is a math based puzzle shooter. Play solo, team up in co-op, or practice your skills to stop the evil PEMDAS minions. Can you save the world with math?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://